        {
          "@value": "What the DAK pre-processing phase actually accomplishes, step by step, before the IG Publisher runs — and which of its steps exist only to satisfy the Publisher's own page index — and how it runs as the overlay on fhir-harness's AST cache refresh (`dak-pre-export.sh`). Read before changing a pre-processing step, before assuming one is needed, and before moving one to another layer."
        }
